# ==============================================================================
# Mahadev Mechanical Car Garage - Frontend Environment Configuration Template
# ==============================================================================
# In local development:
# - Leave blank to use the Vite local proxy configured in vite.config.js (/api/v1 -> http://localhost:5000)
# - Or set: VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000
#
# In production on Vercel:
# - Set VITE_API_URL to your Render backend API base URL or custom API subdomain:
#   Example: VITE_API_URL=https://mahadev-garage-backend.onrender.com
#   Example Custom Domain: VITE_API_URL=https://api.mahadevgarage.com
#
# Note: Vite automatically prefixes /api/v1 if not present.
# ==============================================================================
VITE_API_URL=https://mahadev-garage-backend.onrender.com
